**[+ pl_coup_outcome +].**

[+ pl_coup_story +]

[+ pl_coup_effects +]

- @epilogue: What follows.

@epilogue
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
PolishSecurity.epilogueView(Q);
!}

= What follows

[+ pl_ch2_ending +]

[? if pl_ch2_achievements : [+ pl_ch2_achievements +] ?]

The second chapter, the Republic after the coup, is in preparation. You can read the balance of the first chapter again, look at the state of the country and the Library, or save the game; reload the page to start a new game.

